  "question": {
    "text": "Let $f: R \\rightarrow R$ be a differentiable function having $f(2)=6, f^{\\prime}(2)=\\left(\\frac{1}{48}\\right)$. Then $\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 2} \\int_6^{f(x)} \\frac{4 t^3}{x-2} d t$ equals",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "o4oYQ",
